        <item>
            <title>0.2.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 23:36:10 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>30</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Requires macOS 15.0 or later. Supports Apple Silicon and Intel Macs.</p>
<ul>
<li>Refresh clipboard history with colored content-type icons and improved preview styling.</li>
<li>Show clearer link previews with the domain, full address, and an Open in Browser button.</li>
<li>Make deletion available directly above the preview, alongside pinning, while keeping the full action menu on right-click.</li>
<li>Improve text preview colors in light and dark appearances.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
