        <item>
            <title>0.2.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 21:51:12 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>29</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Requires macOS 15.0 or later. Supports Apple Silicon and Intel Macs.</p>
<ul>
<li>Refresh AI chat with file attachments, image understanding, and improved Markdown/LaTeX rendering.</li>
<li>Update OpenAI model support and add web search support.</li>
<li>Improve clipboard search, pinned items, image OCR, color handling, JSON formatting, and plain-text paste.</li>
<li>Add visual plugin editing, version management, configurable options, and an action testing panel.</li>
<li>Add initial PopClip import support for declarative URL actions, keyboard shortcuts, and plain-text macOS services, with a compatibility report before import.</li>
<li>Complete English and Simplified Chinese localization.</li>
<li>Unify settings and action interfaces, improve application-specific configuration, and refresh usage documentation.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
